{"w":2400,"lines":[{"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","w":0.31893002827962236,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.10082305159813008,"y":0.069767441711350076},{"x":0.098496206028180447,"t":"TEST 8, WRITING TASK 1","y":0.1135876502175478,"w":0.36075729370117193,"h":0.02580157663010596,"c":1},{"x":0.10058277659572185,"y":0.15104756347110981,"h":0.017827842766320323,"w":0.20413232167561846,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER","c":1},{"x":0.098700030411705775,"c":1,"y":0.18638353981569045,"w":0.80467453002929701,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score. Here is the","h":0.019410455746420419},{"x":0.10082304745000642,"t":"examiner's comment:","h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.2063953485612452,"w":0.20576131184895835,"c":1},{"w":0.71193415323893228,"h":0.017667844522968101,"c":1,"y":0.2396937573810678,"x":0.14814814976353261,"t":"The candidate has provided a clear introduction and an overview of the key"},{"y":0.25872093007086483,"x":0.1481481594211429,"w":0.75925923665364581,"c":1,"h":0.017486372881418633,"t":"stages of the process. Each stage is identified and described, although there are"},{"c":1,"x":0.14814815947193702,"w":0.75925923665364581,"y":0.27616279053519865,"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"some minor errors in the reporting of stage 5. There is room for expansion of the"},{"h":0.019818149831747123,"w":0.75939880371093749,"t":"description of each stage, which could help to achieve a higher score. There is a","x":0.14807948910765636,"y":0.29334496845313107,"c":1},{"t":"clear overall progression, with each stage being signalled by appropriate markers","x":0.14814814125028722,"y":0.31242638381909837,"c":1,"w":0.767489725748698,"h":0.017515476797438589},{"y":0.32733943212943561,"t":"[First | in order to | After that | At this point | Then, the final step | Finally]. These","x":0.14596368096902135,"c":1,"w":0.75337168375651042,"h":0.02406623085480275},{"w":0.72427983601888024,"h":0.017476100382450954,"t":"markers are adequate, but a higher score might be achieved by varying their","x":0.14814814775404253,"c":1,"y":0.34883720914252736},{"x":0.14808812548348016,"y":0.36485563160357692,"w":0.76143107096354179,"c":1,"h":0.018890998669591763,"t":"position in each sentence, rather than always placing them at the beginning. The"},{"h":0.022531420659401169,"y":0.37991061447565566,"w":0.75750605265299475,"x":0.14796894006461381,"c":1,"t":"range of vocabulary is adequate for the task and there are attempts to use more"},{"x":0.14814813956852466,"w":0.72222223917643225,"h":0.016195524146054074,"y":0.40253239096710813,"c":1,"t":"variety here [five general steps | connected | accumulated], though there are"},{"y":0.41769137036114823,"t":"some examples of error in word choice [box \/ tank | a circle movements \/ a circular","x":0.14805194899106597,"h":0.018831594532313978,"c":1,"w":0.7800244140625},{"w":0.74300165812174479,"h":0.020533100033817364,"c":1,"x":0.150103611297039,"t":"movement], in spelling [undergrownd | trough | conteiner | sumary] and in word","y":0.43516123437200405},{"x":0.14814814934545267,"h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"y":0.45494186031836481,"w":0.76954732259114578,"t":"formation [condensered \/ condensed | gas \/ gaseous | trasladated \/ transferred? |"},{"w":0.78600819905598951,"y":0.47232037703559293,"x":0.15020577778682007,"c":1,"t":"condensering \/ condensing]. There is a mix of simple and complex sentence forms,","h":0.017505203736825292},{"x":0.14807301301574191,"t":"including accurate use of passive forms. There are some errors [a \/ an | who \/","w":0.73680913289388017,"h":0.018683545300199556,"c":1,"y":0.48945163329056252},{"c":1,"w":0.79024439493815102,"t":"what], but otherwise the level of accuracy is good. The same level of accuracy, over","y":0.50766148112474851,"x":0.15014638058183474,"h":0.018628243984406656},{"y":0.52481558214076984,"h":0.019804438938100355,"x":0.1501193771188582,"t":"a wider range of sentence forms, would increase the score on Grammatical Range","c":1,"w":0.78000605265299483},{"w":0.13845698038736981,"t":"and Accuracy.","x":0.14994928740175539,"h":0.016920616545300859,"y":0.54438490487695745,"c":1},{"x":0.10283274312231308,"y":0.57984255756633774,"w":0.77995966593424493,"t":"The diagram shows how electricity is produced by geothermal energy. There are five","h":0.019435500649316206,"c":1},{"x":0.10485966826106657,"t":"general steps in this process. First, in a big box connecked undergrownd, cold water is","w":0.81907475789388018,"y":0.59759551554534285,"h":0.018712431297706611,"c":1},{"w":0.53102650960286457,"t":"accumulated in order to be pumped down about 4.5 Km.","x":0.10484194055210604,"y":0.61580647535591793,"c":1,"h":0.016276994217691798},{"w":0.79847188313802087,"h":0.020302450137368644,"y":0.64045427100633334,"t":"After that, water is heaked passing trough hot rocks called Geothermal zone and it","x":0.12752841260613859,"c":1},{"w":0.8295241800944011,"c":1,"t":"is pumped up in order to be condensered in a big conteiner. At this point, water is in","x":0.10271717356243613,"h":0.023743686743422865,"y":0.65668121366221799},{"y":0.67521920710544037,"c":1,"w":0.80681940714518219,"x":0.1068592228867819,"t":"a gas state and it is put in a turbine which moves it in a circle movements. Then,","h":0.019721993849611708},{"y":0.69611307446394466,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"the final step is to use a generator in order to water be pawered and energy can be","w":0.79423868815104171,"c":1,"x":0.10493826899492083},{"x":0.10478198980385485,"y":0.7124688710381043,"h":0.021181962515355868,"w":0.53731658935546867,"t":"produced. Finally energy is trasladated to a energy tower.","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12958691280813345,"h":0.017868767638369309,"y":0.73827291995166888,"w":0.7428968811035157,"t":"In sumary, the geothermal power plant is used to create energy in some steps:"},{"y":0.75550841500662003,"w":0.79849619547526052,"c":1,"h":0.019513153777105718,"t":"heating cold waker by a geothermal zone and condensering it in order to put it in a","x":0.10487676967198079},{"w":0.59684361775716144,"h":0.018142666496573367,"c":1,"y":0.77404699866976256,"x":0.1048638712407156,"t":"generator turbine which is who produces the energy to be used."},{"x":0.10699588537720731,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1,"y":0.94331395332993895,"t":"130"},{"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","x":0.39483721299237268,"y":0.96768258536995222,"h":0.016454192297478354,"w":0.20824633280436194}],"h":3395}